{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-process#card-zh","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-process","commit":"b3276f19448f084f75917615b39dcd451e3aa5a0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-process（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在 DSH Web 中管理多阶段、多环节的 agent 工艺模板。它通过侧栏面板、宿主 HTTP 路由和 agent 工具接入工艺库，支持浏览、表单或 YAML 编辑、校验、导入导出、AI 生成，并可逐环节创建会话执行、处理门禁与流程流转。适合希望把可复用工作流交给 agent 按阶段推进的 DSH 用户。默认使用本机工艺目录，无需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:68-75","src/index.js:140-187","src/tools.js:71-185","src/execution.js:88-115"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-process#card-en","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-process","commit":"b3276f19448f084f75917615b39dcd451e3aa5a0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-process is a DSH Web plugin for multi-stage agent workflows. Its panel and tools let users browse, edit, validate, and generate processes. Agents follow steps while the host tracks gates and transitions. It suits teams reusing workflows. Data stays local; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:68-75","src/index.js:140-187","src/tools.js:71-185","src/execution.js:88-115"]}
